<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! library.shelf.lists ~ the collections the acquired shelf holds

`lares library list` reads the acquired library home (`<root>/library`, or `LAR_LIBRARY`) and names each collection by its `library:<collection>` reference, its body count and its bytes. Bodies a human did not author rest here, off every tracked tree. An empty shelf says so and names its home.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ every collection, its bodies and bytes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

